25	/**
26	 * Emits an audit trail entry to the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger whenever an
27	 * owner is first persisted, recording the assigned id, customer code and
28	 * registration date. It also emits an immutable structured {@code OWNER_CREATED}
29	 * JSON event carrying the owner's current primary identifier (the customer code).
30	 */
